======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 154 - Design a Scalable Group Chat Platform
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Sending separate individual push notifications to all 10,000 members synchronously.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Room message queues with batch fanout workers and client-side message reconciliation.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
